{
  "$comment": "The ladder: each item's level (component, card, section, frame or screen) and its category within that level, keyed by registry item name. A component is simple (one control, surface, mark or effect) or composite (several cooperating parts or a model), its `complexity`. The single source for registry meta.level/meta.complexity/meta.category (packages/ui/scripts/generate.mjs), the docs (apps/docs/lib/taxonomy.ts) and the MCP index. An item composes items of its own level or below, never above (pnpm lint:ladder). partOf: shown as part of another item; merge: a group of items to merge into one; flag: a known ladder problem to fix; opens: what a card opens in (dialog, sheet, popover or banner), shown on the card's page; counterpart: the same data at another level (the status card and the status screen), which each screen links. hidden: kept in the repository, the registry and `youj add`, but left out of the docs, search, llms.txt, the MCP index and Create's screen list (bring it back by deleting the flag); inApp: a screen that lives inside an app's content area, which Create offers to add to a frame (not auth, onboarding, checkout, marketing, status or full-page surveys). Visuals (icons, illustrations, loaders, miniatures) are not on the ladder. pnpm check:taxonomy (part of pnpm verify) fails on a registry item with no entry, an entry for no item, or a level that disagrees with the registry type.",
  "levels": {
    "component": { "one": "Component", "many": "Components", "summary": "One control, surface, mark or effect (simple), or several cooperating parts or a model such as rows, series or steps (composite), with generic props: imported from a package.", "categories": { "form-controls": "Form controls", "navigation": "Navigation", "overlays": "Overlays", "display": "Display", "feedback": "Feedback", "actions": "Actions", "effects": "Effects", "data-marks": "Data marks", "capsules": "Capsules", "backgrounds": "Backgrounds", "layout": "Layout", "media": "Media", "charts-and-meters": "Charts & meters", "navigation-and-app-chrome": "Navigation & app chrome", "pickers-and-inputs": "Pickers & inputs", "specialized": "Specialized", "data-and-tables": "Data & tables", "timelines-and-planning": "Timelines & planning", "chat-and-ai": "Chat & AI" } },
